eliable\", \"can make correct decisions quickly\", \"difficulty communicating ideas\", \"regarded as egocentric\". Also B's \"very conscientious\", \"handles stress very well\", \"good at assessing weather conditions\", \"excellent computer skills\". And B's \"relatively weak memory for numbers\" and \"makes nasty remarks\". Use those.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate B."}
